<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĕrīnys</span></b>  (or, less correctly,
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Erinnys</span></b> ; cf. Wagner ad <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 2,
		337</span></i>), yos, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐριννύς</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινύς</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>one of the Furies</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7,
				447</span></i>; <i><span class="en">570</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 1,
				241</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 490</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 14</span></i> et
				saep.—<i>Acc.</i> Erinyn, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 1,
				725</span></i>.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Erinyes,</span>”
				<i>the Furies</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 2, 20, 29</span></i>
			 (3, 13, 29 M.); <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 11, 103</span></i>.—<i>Acc.</i> Erinyas, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th.
				11, 345</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of Helen: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trojae patriae communis Erinys,</span>”
				<i>the scourge</i>, <i>curse</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 573</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Appellatively, <i>fury</i>, <i>frenzy</i>, <i>madness</i> = furor, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 2,
				337</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">civilis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>civil war</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					4, 187</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
